.th PLOT I 5/31/77
.sh NAME
plot: t300, t300s, t450 \*- graphics filters
.sh SYNOPSIS
.bd t300
.br
.bd t300s
.br
.bd t450
.sh DESCRIPTION
These commands read plotting instructions (see
.it plot\c
(V)) from the standard input,
and produce device-dependent plotting instructions
on the standard output.
.s3
.it T300
produces a plot for a GSI 300
terminal on the standard output.
.s3
.it T300s
produces a plot for a GSI 300s
terminal on the standard output.
.s3
.it T450
produces a plot for a DASI 450 terminal on the standard output.
.sh "SEE ALSO"
graph(I), plot(III), plot(V)
